ruby="base">車</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.006" end="12.112">しゃ</span></span></span><span begin="12.112" end="12.208">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.208" end="12.320">と</span></span></span><span begin="12.320" end="12.456">び</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.456" end="12.652">の</span></span></span><span begin="12.652" end="12.966">って</span> <span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">雪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.039" end="14.243">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.243" end="14.475">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">国</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.475" end="14.685">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.685" end="14.909">に</span></span></span><span begin="14.909" end="15.375">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.375" end="16.027">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">周～♪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="16.027" end="17.183">しゅう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或是跳上火车 绕着至冬跑一圈</span></p><p begin="17.709" end="26.828" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.709" end="18.129">お</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="2"><span tts:ruby="base">魚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.129" end="18.585">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.585" end="19.029">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.029" end="19.539">な</span></span></span><span begin="19.539" end="19.959">と</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">歌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.959" end="20.175">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.175" end="20.385">た</span></span></span><span begin="20.385" end="20.611">う</span><span begin="20.611" end="21.129">わ～♪</span> <span begin="21.548" end="21.780">あ</span><span begin="21.780" end="22.186">な</span><span begin="22.186" end="22.666">た</span><span begin="22.666" end="23.116">が</span><span begin="23.116" end="23.356">い</span><span begin="23.356" end="23.566">な</span><span begin="23.566" end="23.790">い</span><span begin="23.790" end="24.226">か</span><span begin="24.226" end="26.828">ら～♪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你好久都没陪我玩 我只能对着鱼唱歌</span></p><p begin="28.658" end="41.821" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.658" end="29.010">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">台</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.010" end="29.438">たい</span></span></span><span begin="29.438" end="29.910">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">満</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.910" end="30.382">まん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">席</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.382" end="30.616">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.616" end="31.072">き</span></span></span><span begin="31.072" end="31.312">で</span><span begin="31.312" end="31.732">も</span> <span begin="32.228" end="32.430">あ</span><span begin="32.430" end="32.678">た</span><span begin="32.678" end="32.872">し</span><span begin="32.872" end="33.106">は</span><span begin="33.106" end="33.562">ひ</span><span begin="33.562" end="33.990">と</span><span begin="33.990" end="34.238">り</span><span begin="34.238" end="34.920">ぼっ</span><span begin="34.920" end="35.566">ち～♪</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.926" end="36.354">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">計</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.354" end="36.750">けい</span></span></span><span begin="36.750" end="37.170">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.170" end="37.598">み</span></span></span><span begin="37.598" end="38.116">つ</span><span begin="38.116" end="39.045">め</span><span begin="39.045" end="39.661">る</span><span begin="39.661" end="39.931">だ</span><span begin="39.931" end="41.821">け～♪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然舞台并不空 但你知道我总是很孤单 看时光滴答流转</span></p><p begin="43.092" end="49.779" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.092" end="43.482">チク</span><span begin="43.482" end="44.114">タク、</span> <span begin="45.009" end="45.323">チク</span><span begin="45.323" end="45.808">タク、</span> <span begin="46.757" end="47.169">チク</span><span begin="47.169" end="49.779">タク～♪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">滴答 滴答 滴答</span></p><p begin="50.376" end="57.344" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.376" end="50.750">チク</span><span begin="50.750" end="51.418">タク、</span> <span begin="52.176" end="52.574">チク</span><span begin="52.574" end="53.256">タク、</span> <span begin="53.990" end="54.410">チク</span><span begin="54.410" end="57.344">タク～♪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">滴答 滴答 滴答</span></p><p begin="58.753" end="1:09.016" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.753" end="59.053">オ</span><span begin="59.053" end="59.443">デッ</span><span begin="59.443" end="1:00.109">ト～♪</span> <span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">雪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.733" end="1:00.905">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.905" end="1:01.093">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:01.093" end="1:01.317">だ</span><span begin="1:01.317" end="1:01.535">る</span><span begin="1:01.535" end="1:01.783">ま</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">作</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.783" end="1:02.577">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:02.577" end="1:03.559">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:03.559" end="1:04.451">り</span><span begin="1:04.933" end="1:05.405">ま</span><span begin="1:05.405" end="1:09.016">しょ～♪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奥黛塔 快陪我去堆个雪人吧</span></p></div></body></tt>